---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CaptureForm from "../../components/forms/capture-form.astro";
import { capture } from "../../../capture.config";
---

<Layout title="Sign PDF Online" seo={{ page_description: "Add an electronic signature to a PDF document." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-balance md:text-5xl">Sign PDF</h1>
      <p class="mb-10 text-lg text-slate-600">Draw, type, or upload your signature to sign any PDF.</p>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Select File to Sign</h2>
        <noscript>
          <div class="bg-rose-50 text-rose-800 p-4 rounded mb-4">
            JavaScript is required to sign files in your browser.
          </div>
        </noscript>
        <div id="tool-ui" class="text-center p-12 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-lg bg-slate-50">
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Upload a document to sign.</p>
          <button class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">Browse File</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Are e-signatures legally binding?</h2>
        <p>
          In most countries, yes. An electronic signature (e-sign) is legally recognized for the vast majority of personal and business transactions. For more information, read our <a href="/blog/esignature-legality-explained">full guide on ESIGN Act compliance</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>What to do after signing</h3>
        <p>It's very important to <a href="/blog/flatten-pdf-meaning">flatten your PDF</a> after signing it so that your signature layer cannot be trivially edited or removed. You may also want to explore <a href="/glossary/digital-signature">digital signatures</a> if you need robust cryptography.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Need to request signatures from others?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Our free tier lets you sign your own documents. To send documents for others to sign securely, join our Pro waitlist.</p>
        <CaptureForm form={capture.forms.waitlist} submitLabel="Join Waitlist">
          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Email address</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required class="w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 focus:border-emerald-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600" />
          </div>
        </CaptureForm>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
